schema: "0.3"
id: echo-of-manifestation-character-echo
type: image
service: gemini

prompt:
  text: >
    Dark fantasy concept art portrait of a 9-year-old girl named Echo standing in absolute
    darkness. She is pale — unnaturally so — with an otherworldly calm expression, neither
    smiling nor sad, simply knowing. She wears a simple cotton dress with a faded floral
    pattern, the style of rural clothing from approximately 200 years ago. Her hair is dark
    and falls loosely past her shoulders. CRITICAL DETAIL: She casts no shadow whatsoever —
    the ground beneath her is lit but there is no corresponding shadow cast by her body, as
    if she is not fully present in the material world. A faint pale luminescence surrounds her
    form, barely perceptible, like moonlight caught in fog. Her eyes are clear and ancient,
    holding knowledge far beyond her apparent age. The background is deep indigo-black with
    very faint ethereal wisps. Painterly style, atmospheric lighting, soft edges where her
    form meets the darkness. The mood is sorrowful beauty and wrongness — something precious
    that should not exist in this place.
  negative: "bright, cheerful, cartoon, anime, clean magic, glowing eyes, scary child horror trope, demonic, monstrous, colorful palette, sharp edges, low detail, cute, playful"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1024
    height: 1536
    aspect_ratio: "2:3"

tags: [character, companion, child, echo, portrait, concept-art, dark-fantasy, no-shadow]
